---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Sankalpam" description="FA4C's women empowerment programme guiding women in distress toward employment and self-sufficiency.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <nav class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-6">
      <a href="/our-programmes/" class="hover:text-[#1a6b3c]">Our Programmes</a> / <span class="text-gray-800">Sankalpam</span>
    </nav>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-[#1a6b3c] mb-2">Sankalpam <span class="text-2xl">👩</span></h1>
    <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-[#e87722] mb-8"></div>

    <img src="/images/2016/Sankalpam-page-001.jpg" alt="Sankalpam Programme" class="rounded-xl shadow-md mb-8 w-full object-cover max-h-72" />

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-gray-700">
      <p>
        The women who are in distress will be supported by our organisation. We will show a way to lead their life. Such women who expect our support to lead their life should have strong determination towards the way of employment shown by us. Thus this programme is named as 'Sankalpam'. All the women empowerment programmes conducted by us are considered as a part of 'Sankalpam'.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#1a6b3c] mt-8 mb-4">Our Activities</h2>
      <ol class="space-y-2">
        <li>Identifying women in distress and providing emotional and practical support.</li>
        <li>Vocational training and skill development workshops.</li>
        <li>Connecting women with employment opportunities.</li>
        <li>Financial guidance and microfinance awareness.</li>
        <li>Self-defence and confidence-building programmes.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
      <a href="/our-programmes/" class="border border-[#1a6b3c] text-[#1a6b3c] font-semibold px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full hover:bg-[#1a6b3c] hover:text-white transition-colors text-sm">← All Programmes</a>
      <a href="/contribute-now/" class="bg-[#e87722] text-white font-semibold px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full hover:bg-[#d06820] transition-colors text-sm">Support This Programme</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
